  "narrative": {
    "text": "Figure 2(b): Precision@5 on the LANGUAGE ablation. Same four series and same fourteen teams as panel (a), y-axis 0 to 0.3, values printed. Annif leads on de all-subjects at 0.269, with DUTIR831 at 0.263 and DNB-AI-Project at 0.254; RUC Team's de tib-core bar is the single tallest at 0.278. icip reads 0.216 / 0.164 / 0.187 / 0.163 and TartuNLP 0.142 / 0.113 / 0.146 / 0.134. The same teams are missing the same parts of the grid as in panel (a). As with the recall panel, some labels overlap and only the legible ones are quoted.",
